ld="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="Code → build → live server" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="5" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="GitHub organisation 'loamz'  (SSH remote: github-personal)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#888888;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="760" height="450" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="loamz-chat&lt;br&gt;Rust crates + web app + Android TWA&lt;br&gt;15 commits not pushed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="330" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="loamz-agents&lt;br&gt;Python: agents server + runtime&lt;br&gt;11 commits not pushed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="90" width="330" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="loamz-data&lt;br&gt;Python: engine, data server, reader, workspace app&lt;br&gt;not deployed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=12;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="210" width="330" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="loamz-python&lt;br&gt;core, identity, data SDKs (shared libraries)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="210" width="330" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="loamz-deploy&lt;br&gt;Ansible roles + build scripts&lt;br&gt;8 commits not pushed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="330" width="330" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Older: loamz, loamz-server (to archive), loamz-platform, loamz-rs, loamz-solutions, *-X12 copies" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=12;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="330" width="330" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="Owner's laptop (WSL)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#888888;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="50" width="580" height="450" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="build.sh&lt;br&gt;cargo zigbuild (aarch64) + wasm-pack + pnpm build&lt;br&gt;→ artifacts/" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="90" width="540" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="build-agents.sh&lt;br&gt;uv build → wheels" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="210" width="540" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="ansible-playbook site.yml&lt;br&gt;roles: base, postgres, keycloak, app, agents, bridge, caddy, backup" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="310" width="540" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="Local dev stack: vite 5173 · chat-server 8090 · agents 8010 (stub model) · Keycloak 8081 · Postgres 5433" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="420" width="540" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="Live VM (page 2)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="540" width="540" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="wheels" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="ssh + files" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#555555;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="Questions: Is there any CI (tests on every push)? Who can push to main? Are the Android build and the 'X12' folders still used? Do you want one repo per product, or one monorepo, long term? Nothing is pushed, so a laptop failure loses ~34 commits." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="520" width="760" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="p7" name="7 · To verify (your checklist)"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="Things nobody has checked yet. Tick them off here." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="5" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;Servers and network&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. rpcbind listens on every interface (port 111). Disable it; confirm from outside that only 22/80/443 answer.&lt;br&gt;2. Is Cloudflare proxying chat. / auth. (orange cloud) or DNS only? It changes who sees visitor IPs.&lt;br&gt;3. Oracle's own network rules: the playbook replaces them with ufw. Confirm nothing else is open.&lt;br&gt;4. SSH is open to the whole internet (keys only + fail2ban). Restrict to your IP, or accept?&lt;br&gt;5. Is the Keycloak admin console reachable from the internet at auth.loamz.com/admin?" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="700" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Backups and recovery&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. Is a Backblaze key set, so dumps really leave the machine? Look at the last upload.&lt;br&gt;7. Has a restore ever been rehearsed (docs/runbooks/restore-database.md)?&lt;br&gt;8. Agents' own files and blobs over 10 MB are not copied off-site. Is that OK?&lt;br&gt;9. The device-authority seed is not in the backup by design. Do you have your own copy (secrets-backup/)?&lt;br&gt;10. One VM, no uptime alert. What tells you it is down?" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="50" width="700" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;Privacy claims vs reality&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;11. The policy says IPs are kept in server logs 30 days. Which logs hold IPs? (Caddy writes no access log.)&lt;br&gt;12. What exactly is sealed at rest in the agents server?&lt;br&gt;13. Does 'Download my data' include agent history stored under both thread-id forms?&lt;br&gt;14. Agents data is not end-to-end: is every screen where that matters clear to users?" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="380" width="700" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;Code and practice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;15. Which old repos can be archived? (loamz, loamz-server, loamz-platform, loamz-rs, loamz-solutions, X12 copies)&lt;br&gt;16. Does anything call loamz-data live? It is not deployed.&lt;br&gt;17. Push the local commits; add CI so tests run on every push.&lt;br&gt;18. Lawyer review of the legal texts (REVIEW.md); Google branding verification result." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="380" width="700" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>